name tabbing
category Package
revision 59715
shortdesc Tabbing with accented letters
relocated 1
longdesc By default, some of the tabbing environment's commands clash
longdesc with default accent commands; LaTeX provides the odd commands
longdesc \a', etc., to deal with the clash. The package offers a variant
longdesc of the tabbing environment which does not create this
longdesc difficulty, so that users need not learn two sets of accent
longdesc commands.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/tabbing/Tabbing.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/Tabbing
catalogue-license lppl1
catalogue-topics alignment macro-supp
